        "text": "The audience values political experience and credentials when evaluating speakers.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker believes that New Hampshire plays a pivotal role in national electoral outcomes.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker assumes that Johnson Unu possesses relevant expertise on federal and state-level elections.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "The audience expects substantive discussion on current political events rather than casual banter.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "Political figures with executive experience are more credible authorities on election issues.",
        "confidence": 0.85
      }
    ],
    "turn_type_label": "Substantive",
    "conversation_move_label": "Assert / Elaborate"
  },
  {
