    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/6/4/64569.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 12,
    "turn_text": "No name that's out there, in my opinion, comes to the top of the pile at this stage. If you ask me who the front runners are, I would say it's Joe Biden and Bernie Sanders, and they're both Dr. Genarians, or almost Dr. Genarians, which is not a good place for the party to be.",
