  },
  {
    "episode_id": 64569,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/6/4/64569.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 15,
    "turn_text": "So touch on that compromise and that common ground aspect. I know that you did this when you were Chief of Staff and that you were able to broker deals, if you will, on the Clean Air Act and certain things. How do you think we can find such common ground and for some of our issues that we face today and for structure other areas that we may find of interest?",
