        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "This honest data collection effort is currently not being carried out.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "Some statistics about bridge safety include non-structural elements like approach roadways not meeting current standards.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "Establishing a common fact-based database is an easy part of the process.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "Public perception is being manipulated by exaggerated statistics about bridge safety.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "Bridges need to be redone.",
